---
source: crates/pvc-cli/tests/cli.rs
expression: help
---
A modern CLI for the PVCplus phase-vocoder toolkit.

Usage: pvc [OPTIONS] <COMMAND>

Commands:
  info     Print information about an audio file or a `.pva` analysis file
  legacy   Run a legacy C tool directly (transition path)
  preset   Manage presets (TOML files consumed by `pvc run`)
  run      Run a preset, optionally overriding fields with `--set key=value`
  fn       Control-function generators (the CARL/cmusic "GEN" family)
  pv       Phase vocoder: analyze then resynthesize
  stretch  Time-stretch only - `pvc pv --stretch <factor>` with everything else at its default
  pitch    Pitch transposition only - `pvc pv --pitch <semitones>` with everything else at its default
  analyze  Phase vocoder analysis only: writes a `.pva` frame file, no resynthesis
  help     Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --quiet
          Suppress non-essential output

      --json
          Emit machine-readable JSON instead of human-readable text

      --dry-run
          Print the resolved parameters/actions without doing anything

  -h, --help
          Print help

  -V, --version
          Print version
